msgctxt "L_DAM_004"
msgid "\\n"
msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_005"
msgid "Deactivate GPS and autopilot\\n"
msgstr "Desactivar GPS y piloto automático\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_006"
msgid "Disable primary power source\\n"
msgstr "Desactivar fuente primaria de energía\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_007"
msgid "Secure laboratories and research data\\n"
msgstr "Asegurar laboratorios y datos\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_008"
msgid "Activate Moon Pool lift\\n"
msgstr "Activar el ascensor de la piscina\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_009"
msgid "Rendezvous and escape with Elvis\\n"
msgstr "Encontrar y escapar con Elvis\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_010"
msgid "Cripple the engines and the ship will \\ndrift... Perfect!\\n"
msgstr "Estropea los motores y la nave irá \\na la deriva... ¡Perfecto!\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_011"
msgid "This must be where the sub's controlled from.\\n"
msgstr "Desde aquí se debe controlar el submarino.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_012"
msgid "Without the autopilot and the GPS, the ship \\nwill wander off station.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Sin el piloto automático y el GPS, la nave \\ndeambulará fuera de la "
"estación.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_013"
msgid "They'll be unable to conduct any operations \\nwithout any power.\\n"
msgstr "No podrán realizar ninguna operación \\nsin energía.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_014"
msgid "Autopilot system has been deactivated.\\n"
msgstr "El sistema de piloto automático ha sido desactivado.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_015"
msgid "GPS system has been deactivated.\\n"
msgstr "El sistema GPS ha sido desactivado.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_016"
msgid "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "Objeto crítico de la misión destruido.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_017"
msgid "Reactor shutdown control hatch opened.\\n"
msgstr "Escotilla del control de apagado del reactor abierta.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_018"
msgid "Reactor has been shut down.\\n"
msgstr "El reactor ha sido apagado.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_019"
msgid "Diving control center has been located.\\n"
msgstr "El centro de control de buceo ha sido localizado.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_020"
msgid "Critical mission personnel killed.\\n"
msgstr "Ha muerto personal crítico de la misión.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_021"
msgid "Research data has been secured.\\n"
msgstr "Datos de investigación asegurados.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_022"
msgid "\\n"
msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_023"
msgid "\\n"
msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_024"
msgid "Research data disk\\n"
msgstr "Disco de datos\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_025"
msgid "A research data disk\\n"
msgstr "Un disco de datos de investigación\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_026"
msgid "Picked up a research data disk.\\n"
msgstr "Disco de datos de investigación obtenido.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_027"
msgid "Critical mission personnel have been killed.\\n"
msgstr "Ha muerto personal crítico de la misión.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_028"
msgid "Lift door has been unlocked.\\n"
msgstr "La puerta del ascensor ha sido abierta.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_029"
msgid "Lift has been activated.\\n"
msgstr "El ascensor ha sido activado.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_030"
msgid "Operation denied - hangar doors still closed.\\n"
msgstr "Operación denegada: puertas del hangar todavía cerradas.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_031"
msgid "Unlocking sequence has been reset.\\n"
msgstr "La secuencia de desbloqueo ha sido reinicializada.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_032"
msgid "You go on ahead, Jo. I'll secure the perimeter. \\nWe'll meet up later.\\n"
msgstr "Ve delante, Joanna. Aseguraré el perímetro. \\nNos vemos más tarde.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_033"
msgid "Elvis has been killed.\\n"
msgstr "Elvis ha muerto.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_034"
msgid ""
"Joanna... What took you so long? Follow me - \\nlet's get out of this old "
"tub.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Joanna... ¿Por qué has tardado tanto? Sígueme. \\nSalgamos de esta vieja "
"bañera.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_035"
msgid "Civilians have been killed.\\n"
msgstr "Han muerto civiles.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_036"
msgid "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "Objeto crítico de la misión destruido.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_037"
msgid "Alarm has been activated.\\n"
msgstr "La alarma ha sido activada.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_038"
msgid "Alarm has been deactivated.\\n"
msgstr "La alarma ha sido desactivada.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_039"
msgid ""
"Right. The diving operation has been disrupted on the surface. \\nTime for a"
" swim.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Correcto. La operación de buceo ha sido desbaratada en la superficie. \\nEs "
"la hora del baño.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_040"
msgid "I hope the government don't want to use this ship anytime soon.\\n"
msgstr "Espero que el gobierno no quiera usar esta nave en breve.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_041"
msgid "Do you think we were a little heavy-handed?\\n"
msgstr "¿Piensas que fuimos un poquito torpes?\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_042"
msgid "Naaahhhh.\\n"
msgstr "Nooohhhh.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_043"
msgid "Pull the plug on that now.\\n"
msgstr "Tira del enchufe ahora.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_044"
msgid "Switch this thing off.\\n"
msgstr "Apaga esa cosa.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_045"
msgid "I'll shut it down.\\n"
msgstr "Lo apagaré.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_046"
msgid "Please don't hurt me.\\n"
msgstr "Por favor, no me hagas daño.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_047"
msgid "Die, you traitors.\\n"
msgstr "Morid, traidores...\\n"
